# This repo deploys as the quiz at quiz.sheisai.ai, so "/" has to be the quiz.
# index.html bounces to the Sol Map, which would win over the rewrite in
# vercel.json if it shipped. Keeping it out of the deployment lets the rewrite
# serve inside-out-quiz.html at the root. The file is untouched locally and the
# Sol Map is still reachable at /sol-map.html.
index.html

